# NHAI EdgeFace Secure – API Documentation

## Overview

These APIs represent the planned interfaces between the frontend, AI modules, storage layer, and cloud synchronization services.

---

# 1. Face Authentication API

## Endpoint

```http
POST /api/recognize
```

## Request

```json
{
  "image": "base64_image_data"
}
```

## Response

```json
{
  "workerId": "WRK-1024",
  "confidence": 96,
  "decision": "Attendance Marked",
  "timestamp": "2026-05-29T22:45:00Z"
}
```

---

# 2. Visitor Registration API

## Endpoint

```http
POST /api/visitor
```

## Request

```json
{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "vehicleNumber": "MH12AB1234",
  "purpose": "Inspection Visit"
}
```

## Response

```json
{
  "status": "QUEUED_FOR_SYNC",
  "visitorId": "VIS-1001"
}
```

---

# 3. Get Pending Logs

## Endpoint

```http
GET /api/logs
```

## Response

```json
{
  "pendingLogs": 5,
  "records": [
    {
      "id": "VIS-1001",
      "status": "QUEUED_FOR_SYNC"
    }
  ]
}
```

---

# 4. Synchronization API

## Endpoint

```http
POST /api/sync
```

## Request

```json
{
  "queueSize": 5
}
```

## Response

```json
{
  "status": "SUCCESS",
  "uploadedRecords": 5,
  "purgedRecords": 5
}
```

---

# 5. Policy Evaluation API

## Endpoint

```http
POST /api/policy
```

## Request

```json
{
  "userType": "known_worker"
}
```

## Response

```json
{
  "action": "MARK_ATTENDANCE"
}
```

---

# Supported Policy Types

* known_worker
* visitor
* temp_worker
* reject
* worker_import

